#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Reading-From-A-Bag-File-CPP.rst:16
msgid ""
"Bag files let you inspect and reuse recorded ROS data from your own "
"applications. This article shows how to create a C++ node that reads "
"messages from a bag file, deserialises them, and republishes selected data. "
"After following these steps, you will be able to build and run a C++ bag "
"reader."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Reading-From-A-Bag-File-CPP.rst:24
msgid "**Goal:** Read data from a bag file to your own C++ node."
